<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT SCOTLAND A IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT SCOTLAND A IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>GALASHIELS, Scotland 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Scotland A 47-20 (halftime 13-11) in a rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Scotland A - Try: Tom Smith. Penalties: Duncan Hodge (4). Dropped goal: Hodge.</p>
<p>Australia - Tries: Tim Horan (2), Mathew Burke, Mark Connors, Sam Payne. Conversions: Burke (5). Penalties: Burke (4).</p>
